# LARAVEL RULES

## FLOW (MANDATORY)

Controller → FormRequest → Service → Resource

## CONTROLLER

- No business logic
- Use FormRequest

## SERVICE

- Handle all business logic
- No $request usage

## DB

- Use Eloquent
- Avoid N+1 (use with())

## SECURITY

- Use $request->validated()
- No hardcode secrets

## API

- Use Resource
